
### Create Pattern
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patterns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Singleton",
  "category": "CREATIONAL",
  "shortDescription": "Ensures a class has only one instance",
  "description": "Provides a global access point to a single instance."
}

### All Patterns
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patterns

### Creational Patterns
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patterns?category=CREATIONAL

### Wrong Patterns category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patterns?category=CREATIONAL

### One Pattern
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patterns/1

### Wrong id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patterns/999

### Delete by id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/patterns/1